  m_text: 'Once a Fae is submitted to its throne, its panel in the collection list
    on the right will be covered with a check. Each Fae returned to its throne will
    in turn weaken the strength of the seal blocking you from progressing to find
    Ex. The seal will be broken entirely after submitting all four of the arbiter
    Fae.


    Once the seal is broken, you will be able to scale the cliffs using
    platforms both floating and ingrained into the cliffsides in order to find Ex
    and complete the game.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 61ee585ef45a8844c8bdd3ffdea34522, type: 2}
