      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'You can keep track of the Fae you have found by looking at the panel on
    the right of the screen as you navigate through the game. Each Fae''s respective
    panel will light up once you have collected them.


    Once you have obtained
    a Fae, you can submit it to its designated throne on the Altar object found at
    the centre of the forest area. You can find out what throne each Fae belongs
    to by checking the colour of the tiles in front of the four thrones, which match
    the colour of the Fae that belongs on each throne. '
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
